Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 04:03:29 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Launcher3: swipe up past a threshold to open the app in a
 floating window

Swipe up from an app and keep dragging. Past the chosen distance the
phone vibrates once; releasing there sends the launcher home and opens
the app as a floating window instead.

Settings (Home settings):
- Swipe up for floating window (off by default)
- Swipe distance: 45-80% of the screen height (default 60%)
- Method: native freeform, LMOFreeform (default) or app bubble
